{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "agent_slug": "kosher-vacation-planner",
  "agent_root": {
    "display_name": "Kosher Vacation Planner",
    "description": "Plans and compares two vacation destinations for kosher-observant travellers. Checks weather, kosher restaurant availability via Geoapify, Shabbat times, and currency — then recommends the best option with a scored explanation.",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "icon": "✈️",
    "category": "travel",
    "capabilities": { "streaming": false, "push_notifications": false }
  },
  "skills": [
    {
      "skill_id": "plan-vacation",
      "name": "Plan Vacation",
      "description": "Takes user preferences (two destinations, travel dates, budget currency) and returns a scored recommendation.",
      "tags": ["travel", "kosher", "weather", "shabbat"],
      "input_modes": ["text/plain"],
      "output_modes": ["text/plain"],
      "examples": [
        "Compare Rome and Barcelona for a kosher trip in September with a budget in ILS"
      ],
      "input_schema": {},
      "output_schema": {},
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "input",
          "type": "input",
          "config": { "bindings": { "text": "user_request" } },
          "next": ["parse-prefs"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 40 }
        },

        {
          "id": "parse-prefs",
          "type": "llm",
          "config": {
            "provider": "anthropic",
            "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001",
            "system_prompt": "You extract structured travel preferences from user input. Output ONLY valid JSON with no markdown, no explanation, no code fences. The JSON must have exactly these keys:\n{\n  \"city1\": \"Rome\",\n  \"city1_lat\": \"41.9028\",\n  \"city1_lon\": \"12.4964\",\n  \"city1_tz\": \"Europe/Rome\",\n  \"city2\": \"Barcelona\",\n  \"city2_lat\": \"41.3851\",\n  \"city2_lon\": \"2.1734\",\n  \"city2_tz\": \"Europe/Madrid\",\n  \"budget_currency\": \"ILS\"\n}\nAll lat/lon must be decimal strings. Timezone must be a valid IANA timezone. Currency must be 3-letter ISO 4217. If the user does not specify two cities, choose two popular cities in the region that are known for having kosher food options.",
            "user_prompt": "{{.user_request}}",
            "max_tokens": 300,
            "output_var": "prefs_json"
          },
          "next": ["extract-prefs"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 160 }
        },

        {
          "id": "extract-prefs",
          "type": "transform",
          "config": {
            "expressions": {},
            "extractions": [
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "city1",           "var": "city1" },
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "city1_lat",       "var": "city1_lat" },
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "city1_lon",       "var": "city1_lon" },
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "city1_tz",        "var": "city1_tz" },
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "city2",           "var": "city2" },
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "city2_lat",       "var": "city2_lat" },
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "city2_lon",       "var": "city2_lon" },
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "city2_tz",        "var": "city2_tz" },
              { "from_var": "prefs_json", "json_path": "budget_currency", "var": "budget_currency" }
            ]
          },
          "next": ["weather-city1"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 280 }
        },

        {
          "id": "weather-city1",
          "type": "http",
          "config": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url_template": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude={{.city1_lat}}&longitude={{.city1_lon}}&daily=temperature_2m_max,temperature_2m_min,precipitation_sum,weathercode&timezone=auto&forecast_days=7",
            "headers": { "Accept": "application/json" },
            "extractions": [],
            "timeout_seconds": 15
          },
          "next": ["store-weather1"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 400 }
        },

        {
          "id": "store-weather1",
          "type": "transform",
          "config": {
            "expressions": { "weather1_raw": "{{.http_response}}" },
            "extractions": []
          },
          "next": ["shabbat-city1"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 500 }
        },

        {
          "id": "shabbat-city1",
          "type": "http",
          "config": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url_template": "https://www.hebcal.com/shabbat?cfg=json&geo=pos&latitude={{.city1_lat}}&longitude={{.city1_lon}}&tzid={{.city1_tz}}&M=on",
            "headers": { "Accept": "application/json" },
            "extractions": [],
            "timeout_seconds": 15
          },
          "next": ["store-shabbat1"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 600 }
        },

        {
          "id": "store-shabbat1",
          "type": "transform",
          "config": {
            "expressions": { "shabbat1_raw": "{{.http_response}}" },
            "extractions": []
          },
          "next": ["kosher-city1"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 700 }
        },

        {
          "id": "kosher-city1",
          "type": "http",
          "config": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url_template": "https://api.geoapify.com/v2/places?categories=catering.restaurant.kosher&filter=circle:{{.city1_lon}},{{.city1_lat}},5000&limit=10&format=json",
            "headers": { "Accept": "application/json" },
            "extractions": [],
            "timeout_seconds": 15,
            "app_param_key": "geoapify_key",
            "inject_mode": "query",
            "inject_header_name": "apiKey"
          },
          "next": ["store-kosher1"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 800 }
        },

        {
          "id": "store-kosher1",
          "type": "transform",
          "config": {
            "expressions": { "kosher1_raw": "{{.http_response}}" },
            "extractions": []
          },
          "next": ["weather-city2"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 900 }
        },

        {
          "id": "weather-city2",
          "type": "http",
          "config": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url_template": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude={{.city2_lat}}&longitude={{.city2_lon}}&daily=temperature_2m_max,temperature_2m_min,precipitation_sum,weathercode&timezone=auto&forecast_days=7",
            "headers": { "Accept": "application/json" },
            "extractions": [],
            "timeout_seconds": 15
          },
          "next": ["store-weather2"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1000 }
        },

        {
          "id": "store-weather2",
          "type": "transform",
          "config": {
            "expressions": { "weather2_raw": "{{.http_response}}" },
            "extractions": []
          },
          "next": ["shabbat-city2"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1100 }
        },

        {
          "id": "shabbat-city2",
          "type": "http",
          "config": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url_template": "https://www.hebcal.com/shabbat?cfg=json&geo=pos&latitude={{.city2_lat}}&longitude={{.city2_lon}}&tzid={{.city2_tz}}&M=on",
            "headers": { "Accept": "application/json" },
            "extractions": [],
            "timeout_seconds": 15
          },
          "next": ["store-shabbat2"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1200 }
        },

        {
          "id": "store-shabbat2",
          "type": "transform",
          "config": {
            "expressions": { "shabbat2_raw": "{{.http_response}}" },
            "extractions": []
          },
          "next": ["kosher-city2"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1300 }
        },

        {
          "id": "kosher-city2",
          "type": "http",
          "config": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url_template": "https://api.geoapify.com/v2/places?categories=catering.restaurant.kosher&filter=circle:{{.city2_lon}},{{.city2_lat}},5000&limit=10&format=json",
            "headers": { "Accept": "application/json" },
            "extractions": [],
            "timeout_seconds": 15,
            "app_param_key": "geoapify_key",
            "inject_mode": "query",
            "inject_header_name": "apiKey"
          },
          "next": ["store-kosher2"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1400 }
        },

        {
          "id": "store-kosher2",
          "type": "transform",
          "config": {
            "expressions": { "kosher2_raw": "{{.http_response}}" },
            "extractions": []
          },
          "next": ["currency-rates"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1500 }
        },

        {
          "id": "currency-rates",
          "type": "http",
          "config": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url_template": "https://api.frankfurter.dev/v1/latest?base=EUR",
            "headers": { "Accept": "application/json" },
            "extractions": [],
            "timeout_seconds": 10
          },
          "next": ["store-currency"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1600 }
        },

        {
          "id": "store-currency",
          "type": "transform",
          "config": {
            "expressions": { "currency_raw": "{{.http_response}}" },
            "extractions": []
          },
          "next": ["score-and-recommend"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1700 }
        },

        {
          "id": "score-and-recommend",
          "type": "llm",
          "config": {
            "provider": "anthropic",
            "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001",
            "system_prompt": "You are a travel advisor specialising in kosher-observant Jewish travellers. Analyse the weather, kosher restaurant search results, Shabbat times, and currency data for two cities and write a clear vacation recommendation.\n\nStructure your response exactly like this:\n\n🏆 Recommended: [WINNING CITY]\n\n📊 Score Comparison\n| Category | [City 1] | [City 2] |\n|---|---|---|\n| Weather (out of 10) | X | X |\n| Kosher options (out of 10) | X | X |\n| Shabbat convenience (out of 10) | X | X |\n| Budget/value (out of 10) | X | X |\n| TOTAL | X | X |\n\n✅ Why [WINNING CITY] wins:\n• [specific reason citing actual data]\n• [specific reason]\n• [specific reason]\n\n🕯️ Shabbat info for [WINNING CITY]:\n• Candle lighting: [exact time from Hebcal data]\n• Havdalah: [exact time]\n\n🍽️ Kosher dining:\n• [number] kosher options found within 5km\n• [name 1-2 specific places if available in the data]\n\n💰 Budget note:\n• Daily estimate in [user currency]: [range based on EUR exchange rate]\n\nScoring: Weather — 22-28°C avg = 10, 18-22°C = 8, <15°C or >33°C = 5, heavy rain = -2. Kosher — 5+ places = 10, 3-4 = 7, 1-2 = 4, 0 = 0. Shabbat — candle lighting 18:00-20:30 = 10, outside = lower. Budget — infer from EUR rate.",
            "user_prompt": "User request: {{.user_request}}\n\nCity 1: {{.city1}} (lat={{.city1_lat}}, lon={{.city1_lon}})\nCity 1 weather: {{.weather1_raw}}\nCity 1 Shabbat/holidays: {{.shabbat1_raw}}\nCity 1 kosher restaurants (Geoapify): {{.kosher1_raw}}\n\nCity 2: {{.city2}} (lat={{.city2_lat}}, lon={{.city2_lon}})\nCity 2 weather: {{.weather2_raw}}\nCity 2 Shabbat/holidays: {{.shabbat2_raw}}\nCity 2 kosher restaurants (Geoapify): {{.kosher2_raw}}\n\nCurrency rates (EUR base): {{.currency_raw}}\nUser preferred currency: {{.budget_currency}}",
            "max_tokens": 1000,
            "output_var": "recommendation"
          },
          "next": ["check-recommendation"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1820 }
        },

        {
          "id": "check-recommendation",
          "type": "branch",
          "config": {
            "expression": "{{.recommendation}}"
          },
          "next": ["final-response", "error-response"],
          "position": { "x": 160, "y": 1960 }
        },

        {
          "id": "final-response",
          "type": "response",
          "config": {
            "from_var": "recommendation",
            "media_type": "text/plain"
          },
          "next": [],
          "position": { "x": 60, "y": 2080 }
        },

        {
          "id": "error-response",
          "type": "response",
          "config": {
            "from_var": "prefs_json",
            "media_type": "text/plain"
          },
          "next": [],
          "position": { "x": 340, "y": 2080 }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
